{{Faction | faction = The Mathematicians | image1 = SectMathematicians2e.png | caption-image1 = | nickname = | philosophy = Solve Mechanus, and solve the multiverse. | founded = | factol = | sigilhq = | homefield = [[Mechanus]] | allies = [[Fraternity of Order]], [[Harmonium]], [[Mercykillers]] | enemies = | predecessor = | successor = }}
The '''Mathematicians''' are a [[sect]] splintered off from the [[Fraternity of Order]]. They believe anything that can be imagined in [[Mechanus]] exists there in some form, and they want to discover the means to find it, using math, logic, and symbolism.
