{{Faction | faction = Merkhants | image1 = | caption-image1 = | nickname = Misers, Gold-hounds, the Hidden Hand | philosophy = Money is power. | founded = | factol = | sigilhq = | homefield = [[Outlands]] | allies = [[Believers of the Source]], [[Fated]] | enemies = [[Fraternity of Order]], [[Transcendent Order]] | predecessor = | successor = }}
The '''Merkhants''' are a [[sect]] who believe that money is the secret to the multiverse. Need protection? Hire it. Want laws changed? Grease a few palms. If there's anything a cutter with gold wants, it's only a matter of setting the right price.
== History ==
== Philosophy ==
There's no such think as too much jink. If two people want something, the one with the most money gets it. The whole multiverse is about seeing who can get the most coin (and hold on to it). Raw physical wealth will lead to domination of the multiverse.
== Role ==
== Membership == : ''See also'': [[List of Merkhants members]]
