{{otheruses|Monster Manual}} {{Book | image = Monster manual II (1).jpg | caption = | code = 2016 | title = Monster Manual II 1st edition | author = [[Gary Gygax]] | editor = | publisher = [[TSR, Inc]] | volume = | type = Accessory | languages = | reprinted = | cover_artist = [[Jeff Easley]] | inter_artist = [[Jim Holloway]], [[Harry Quinn]], [[David C. Sutherland III]], [[Larry Elmore]] | cartography = | typography = | realm year = | setting = | game_edition = 1 | edition1 = <!-- leave blank if there is only one --> | binding1 = Hardback | released1 = August 1983 | pages1 = 160 | isbn10 = 0-88038-031-4 | isbn13 = 978-0880380317 | cite1 = | edition2 = | binding2 = | released2 = | pages2 = | isbn10-2 = | isbn13-2 = | cite2 = | edition3 = | binding3 = | released3 = | pages3 = | isbn10-3 = | isbn13-3 = | cite3 = | edition4 = | binding4 = | released4 = | pages4 = | isbn10-4 = | isbn13-4 = | cite4 = | edition5 = | binding5 = | released5 = | pages5 = | isbn10-5 = | isbn13-5 = | cite5 = | series = | preceded_by = [[Fiend Folio 1st edition|''Fiend Folio'' 1{{st}} edition]] | followed_by = | source = <ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.dmsguild.com/product/17005/Monster-Manual-II-%281e%29?affiliate_id=4782917|title=Monster Manual II (1e)|author=Shannon Appelcline|accessdate=2013-11-13|publisher=Dungeon Masters Guild}}</ref> | Roll20number = 17005 }} '''''Monster Manual II 1st edition''''' is a 1{{st}}-edition ''Advanced Dungeons & Dragons'' accessory. It details many new monsters. {{Quote|''"the most complete alphabetical listing and description of the latest AD&D&trade; game creatures"''
A ''must'' for the serious AD&D&trade; game player. This manual contains all the new members, from [[Abishai]] to [[Zygom]], including new creatures like the [[Deadly pudding|Deadly Pudding]], [[Deva]]s, and Valley Elves. And you'll also have the advantage of the extended lists of [[lycanthropes]], [[giant]]s, and other beasts.|Back-cover text}}
==Description== ''Monster Manual II 1st edition'' was a 160-page hardcover book published in 1983, credited solely to [[Gary Gygax]], which featured cover art by [[Jeff Easley]] and featured interior illustrations by [[Jim Holloway]], [[Harry Quinn]], [[Dave Sutherland]], and [[Larry Elmore]].
The book was a supplement describing over 250 monsters, most with illustrations. Many of the monsters were drawn from scenario modules. It included random encounter tables for dungeon and wilderness settings built from the ''[[Monster Manual 1st edition|Monster Manual]]'' and ''[[Fiend Folio 1st edition|Fiend Folio]]''. It also introduced a dozen new [[devil]]s that had been first published in the pages of ''[[Dragon (magazine)|Dragon]]'' magazine. Like the ''Fiend Folio'' before it, the monsters in ''Monster Manual II 1st edition'' listed the experience point value for each monster within the entry. ''Monster Manual II 1st edition''. along with ''[[Unearthed Arcana 1st edition|Unearthed Arcana]]''. featured quite a number of monsters, races, and places from Gary Gygax's ''Greyhawk'' Campaign world. ==Index== {{IndexLink|Click here for page index}} {{Index |title =Characters |index ={{P|[[Amon]]|44}};{{P|[[Anthraxus]]|30}};{{P|[[Bael]]|44}};{{P|[[Baphomet]]|35}};{{P|[[Belial]]|44}};{{P|[[Cat lord]]|22}};{{P|[[Charon]]|28}};{{P|[[Fraz-Urb'luu]]|35}};{{P|[[Glasya]]|44}};{{P|[[Graz'zt]]|35}};{{P|[[Hutijin]]|44}};{{P|[[Kostchtchie]]|35}};{{P|[[Mammon]]|44}};{{P|[[Mephistopheles]]|44}};{{P|[[Moloch]]|44}};{{P|[[Pazuzu]]|35}};{{P|[[Primus]]|91}} |ref ={{P|[[Abigor]]|44}};{{P|[[Abraxus]]|35}};{{P|[[Adonides]]|44}};{{P|[[Adramelech]]|44}};{{P|[[Agares]]|44}};{{P|[[Ahazu]]|35}};{{P|[[Ahrimanes]]|35}};{{P|[[Alastor]]|44}};{{P|[[Aldinach]]|35}};{{P|[[Alocer]]|44}};{{P|[[Alrunes]]|35}};{{P|[[Amduscias]]|44}};{{P|[[Anarazel]]|35}};{{P|[[Ansitif]]|35}};{{P|[[Ardat]]|35}};{{P|[[Areex]]|35}};{{P|[[Arioch]]|44}};{{P|[[Aseroth]]|35}};{{P|[[Asima]]|35}};{{P|[[Asmodeus]]|44}};{{P|[[Astaroth]]|35}};{{P|[[Azael]]|35}};{{P|[[Azazel]]|35}};{{P|[[Baalberith]]|44}};{{P|[[Baalphegor]]|44}};{{P|[[Baalzebul]]|44}};{{P|[[Baalzephon]]|44}};{{P|[[Baltazo]]|35}};{{P|[[Balan]]|44}};{{P|[[Barbas]]|44}};{{P|[[Barbatos]]|44}};{{P|[[Barbu]]|35}};{{P|[[Bathym]]|44}};{{P|[[Bel]]|44}};{{P|[[Bele]]|44}};{{P