{{Book | image = MC8-cover.jpg | code = TSR2118 (MC8) | title = Monstrous Compendium: Outer Planes Appendix | author = [[J. Paul LaFountain]] | editor = [[Timothy B. Brown]] | cover_artist = [[Jeff Easley]] | inter_artist = [[Thomas Baxa]] | typography = [[Tracey Zamagne]] | publisher = [[TSR]] | released = January 1991 | type = Accessory | binding = Paperback | pages = 96 | game_edition = 2 | isbn10 = 1560760559 | isbn13 = 978-1560760559 | citetitle = Monstrous Compendium: Outer Planes Appendix | Roll20number = 16892 }} '''''Monstrous Compendium: Outer Planes Appendix''''' is an accessory for AD&D 2nd edition.
{{Quote|''Welcome to the Monstrous Compendium volume that finally details the powerful creatures unique to the outer planes. These denizens of the planes can be powerful allies or terrible enemies. From aasimon to zoveri, and everything between, this supplement is a must have for any DM planning to run an adventure in the outer planes.''}}
