This book contains more than 600 monsters, including all the creatures from the [[Monstrous Compendium Volume One|Monstrous Compendium Volumes 1]] and [[Monstrous Compendium Volume Two|2]]! In addition, there are monsters from the other Monstrous Compendium Volumes, and some creatures never seen in the second edition ''AD&D'' Game before. Entries have been reorganized, corrected, updated, and fully cross-referenced, to make this the most valuable monster reference ever!}}
==Description== The ''Monstrous Manual'' is a comprehensive bestiary for ''Advanced Dungeons & Dragons''. It consolidates and refines a wide array of monsters and creatures previously dispersed across the initial loose-leaf ''[[Monstrous Compendium]]'' volumes and various appendices, offering Dungeon Masters and players a unified, hardbound reference.
The ''Monstrous Manual'' organizes its entries alphabetically, each providing a comprehensive overview of a creature, including its physical description, behavior, combat strategies, and special abilities. It also includes the ecological and societal roles of a creature. These entries are accompanied by illustrations.
